schema: "0.4"
id: npl-ux-d1-icon-rail-palette-files-editor
type: image
quality: high

# Direction D1: icon-rail + command palette — screen: VFS file tree, editor, inspector with live badge
# Nocturne palette (exact hexes, dark-native canvas — never pure #000/#fff): canvas #010409, panel #0d1117, raised #161b22, border #21262d, primary text #e6edf3 (soft off-white ink), secondary text #909dab, muted text #6e7681, signal green (live/primary accent) #3fb950, link cyan (navigation) #58a6ff, amber (rare warning) #d29922, error coral #f85149. Type: Inter for UI/labels, JetBrains Mono (co-equal voice) for counts, timestamps, ids, code, SQL, paths. Shape: flat surfaces separated by lightness steps only, 4px radius, no drop shadows, no glow, no gradients, no neon bloom, no OLED pitch-black, no pure-white surfaces.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity dark-native app UI
    for NoizuPromptLingo, a prompt-definition-language + MCP toolchain for agent
    engineers. This direction is a collapsible 56px ICON RAIL with a command
    palette overlay and top breadcrumbs. The rail is icon-only (labels appear on
    hover/expand, not shown expanded here); an org switcher sits at the very top
    of the rail above the destination icons. Render as a real product screenshot,
    never a wireframe.
  text: |
        A 16:9 high-fidelity UI mockup of NoizuPromptLingo's Files (VFS) screen,
        testing the ICON-RAIL shell direction: tree | editor | inspector.

        LEFT: the same 56px icon-only rail as the home shot — org switcher
        avatar at top, 8 icon destinations, the Files icon active with a 2px
        signal-green left edge.

        TOP: breadcrumb bar reading "NoizuPromptLingo / Acme Robotics / Files /
        prod-db-mount / schema / users.sql", with a small green "connected"
        status pill near the mount name.

        Next to the rail, a narrower FILE TREE column (panel tone #0d1117):
        a mount picker dropdown "prod-db-mount ▾" at top, then an indented tree
        — folders "schema/", "migrations/", "seeds/" and files "users.sql"
        (selected, highlighted row), "sessions.sql", "tickets.sql",
        "audit_log.sql" — each with a small file-type glyph in mono-adjacent
        styling.

        CENTER: a wide CODE EDITOR pane on the darkest canvas, monospace
        JetBrains Mono SQL content with line numbers, syntax-colored keywords
        using ONLY the theme palette (signal green for a couple of keywords,
        cyan for identifiers, muted grey for comments) — realistic SQL like
        "CREATE TABLE users (\n  id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,\n  email TEXT NOT
        NULL UNIQUE,\n  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()\n);". A thin
        top editor tab bar shows "users.sql ●" (unsaved dot) and a small LIVE
        badge — a pill with a pulsing green dot and text "LIVE" — indicating a
        real-time update channel is connected.

        RIGHT: an INSPECTOR panel (raised tone #161b22) showing file metadata:
        "Path" (mono), "Size" ("4.2 KB"), "Last revised" (mono timestamp),
        "Revised by" (avatar + name), and a scope/permission chip reading
        "write: org-admin" in muted styling, plus a small "History" list of 3
        mono revision entries.

        Use realistic, specific product content throughout — never lorem ipsum.

  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI, neon glow, bloom, CRT scanlines, gradient background, pure-black OLED background, pure-white surfaces, warm amber/gold dominant palette, light-mode canvas"

attachments:
  - path: _nocturne-palette.png
    role: reference
    description: "Locked Nocturne palette swatches (bg, surface, border, text, muted, accent, success, danger) with hex labels — match these exact colors, do not reinterpret."

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

service: gemini
provider_options:
  generate_content_model: gemini-2.5-flash-image

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Shows the icon-rail shell (org switcher + active Files icon), breadcrumb path into a VFS mount, a file tree sidebar, a monospace SQL code editor with a pulsing LIVE update badge, and a right inspector panel with file metadata and revision history"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Dark-native Nocturne canvas (#010409/#0d1117), single phosphor-green #3fb950 signal, link cyan #58a6ff, amber #d29922 used sparingly, mono-first counts/timestamps/ids in JetBrains Mono, 4px radius, flat surface-step elevation, no shadow/glow/gradient"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Clear three-column dual-sidebar-plus-canvas layout, editor is the dominant wide pane, tree and inspector are narrower flanking columns"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"
    - "neon glow, bloom, or gradient wash"
    - "light-mode or warm/gold dominant canvas instead of dark-native Nocturne"

tags: [ux-overhaul, npl-nocturne, NoizuPromptLingo, shell-direction, direction-1]
